; data). Used by #R$E40F, $859A, #R$6F00. $17-$1F: CYCLONE logo (menu title, 9
; characters); $20 space; $21 "!"; $22 blank; $23/$24 WIND FORCE bar end caps;
; $25/$26 DANGER bar end pattern; $27 cyclone symbol (map key); $28
; helicopter-position symbol (map key); $29/$2A arrows; $2B ","; $2C-$2F "-./"
; glyphs; $30-$39 digits; $3A "|" and $3B "-" (HUD rules); $3C-$40 the large
; "VIEW" HUD label; $41-$5A A-Z.
