; Island names (map labels)
;
; Printed by $8DE2/#R$8DEE in the 4x8 font (#R$6B00) at the label position of
; each island record (#R$F230), in record order. The first byte is skipped. '?'
; is a space; $FD = append " ISLAND" (#R$6AC2) and go to the next island; $FE =
; next island; $FF = end.
