; Per-life reset values of the variable block
;
; After a lost life 92B3 copies these 100 bytes over #R$7500, except that a
; byte of $FF leaves the variable unchanged (time bar #R$751C, map marker
; pointers #R$7543-$754A, cyclone state #R$754B/#R$754C/#R$754E/#R$754F and
; crates #R$7554 survive a death). The values otherwise equal #R$7564.
